                <p class="section-subtitle">Men's intimate hygiene has been ignored for too long</p>
            </div>
            <div class="problem-grid">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-train"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="problem-title">During Travel</h3>
                    <p class="problem-desc">Long journeys without access to proper washing facilities lead to discomfort and odor.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-briefcase"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="problem-title">At Work</h3>
                    <p class="problem-desc">12+ hour workdays in professional settings with no privacy for proper hygiene.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-dumbbell"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="problem-title">After Gym</h3>
                    <p class="problem-desc">Sweat and bacteria buildup after workouts, but communal showers aren't private.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-ban"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="problem-title">Current Solutions Fail</h3>
                    <p class="problem-desc">Wet wipes cause irritation, water isn't available, and most men suffer in silence.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="problem-stats">
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <div class="stat-number">68<span class="stat-percent">%</span></div>
                    <div class="stat-text">of Indian men experience intimate discomfort during travel</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <div class="stat-number">0</div>
                    <div class="stat-text">products designed specifically for male anatomy & on-the-go use</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Solution Section -->
