                <p class="section-subtitle">Why ShieldSleeve works when others would fail</p>
            </div>
            <div class="works-grid">
                <div class="works-card">
                    <div class="works-card-header">
                        <div class="works-card-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-industry"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="works-card-title">Existing Manufacturing</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p>Uses standard condom production lines at HLL Lifecare (world's largest condom factory). No custom machinery needed.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="works-card">
                    <div class="works-card-header">
                        <div class="works-card-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-file-contract"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="works-card-title">Cosmetic Classification</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p>Not a medical device. CDSCO cosmetic approval takes 6-9 months (not 3+ years for drugs).</p>
                </div>
                <div class="works-card">
                    <div class="works-card-header">
                        <div class="works-card-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-rupee-sign"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="works-card-title">Razor-Thin COGS</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p>₹9.50 cost per unit. 81% gross margin at ₹89 MRP. Economics work at scale.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="works-card">
                    <div class="works-card-header">
                        <div class="works-card-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-store"></i>
